{"id":"00046","root":"uni00046_1","name":{"ja":"水城　ゆきかぜ","en":"Mizuki Yukikaze"},"title":{"ja":"【雷撃のバレンタイン】","en":"【Lightning Valentine】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【雷撃のバレンタイン】 水城　ゆきかぜ","en":"【Lightning Valentine】 Mizuki Yukikaze"},"aliases":["Demon Yukikaze"],"element":"Natural","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":12,"profile":{"ja":"代々、“雷遁の術”使いを輩出する名門で彼女も亡き父親同様、“雷遁の術”を使う。“雷遁の術”とは雷を操る強力な術で攻撃系忍法では最強の火力と言われているもの。その中でも彼女の操る雷撃は強力すぎて制御が難しいため、術を行使する触媒として特別に制作された銃を使用している。ゆきかぜはその銃に雷撃の弾丸を生み出し、強力な雷撃弾を発射する事ができる。二丁拳銃を得物に、舞うように雷撃弾を放つその姿から“雷撃の対魔忍”の異名を持つ。勝気で負けず嫌い、プライドの高さがたまにキズで唯一心を許せる存在な幼馴染みの秋山達郎。彼となかなか恋愛関係に進展できないのが悩み。とにかく体を動かして遊ぶのが好きで年中日焼けしている美少女。","en":"Mizuki Yukikaze comes from a prestigious lineage that has produced masters of the \"Lightning Technique\" for generations, and like her late father, she also wields that art. The Lightning Technique manipulates thunder and is said to be the most powerful offensive ninjutsu. Because her lightning strikes are so potent they're hard to control, she uses a specially crafted gun as a catalyst. She generates lightning-charged bullets in the gun and can fire devastating lightning projectiles. Armed with a pair of pistols, she unleashes a dance of lightning bolts, earning her the nickname \"Lightning-strike Taimanin.\" She is headstrong, hates losing, and her high pride is occasionally wounded, leaving only her childhood friend Akiyama Tatsuro as someone she truly trusts. She worries that she can't advance their relationship. Always eager to stay active, she loves to play outdoors and is a sun-kissed beauty year-round."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"氷室百合","forms":[{"id":"uni00046_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[854,1708],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[76,152],"def":[115,230],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","111"]},{"id":"uni00046_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1308,2616],"sp":[250,250